WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.520
Star height at most three.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:06.920
With complement allowed, nobody could prove any fixed bound on nested stars.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.051
Cut every word into marked pieces, twice,

4
00:00:11.051 --> 00:00:12.981
passing the state across each cut.

5
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.349
Claimed: three nested stars always suffice.

6
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.514
Lean checks the theorem.
